      children: "Gita ka aathrahvan adhyay — sabse lamba, sabse vyapak, sabse antim. 78 shlokon ka yeh adhyay Gita ki pooree yaatra ka saar hai. Krishna ne sab kuch kah diya: karma, gyan, bhakti, gun, purushottam, daivasura — ab woh sab kuch ek saath bina. Osho is adhyay ko Gita ka \"synthesis\" kehte hain — chaar margon ka chauraha jahan sab raaste milte hain. Lekin Osho ki sabse badi baat is adhyay ke baare mein yeh hai: Krishna kuch \"samapt\" nahin kar raha — woh Arjun ko \"bhеja\" de raha hai. Utho, laro, jiyo."
